{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">一名海外珠寶商來港參展，在酒店大堂懷疑被偷去總值近100萬元珠寶原石。警方調查後拘捕一人。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方相信已起回所有贓物，涉及的珠寶原石總值約100萬元。警方指，事發在星期日下午2時，一名海外珠寶商來港參展，入住機場鄰近酒店，在酒店大堂休息期間，懷疑遭人偷走一批珠寶原石。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JEWELLERY-1200_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026XlOY6Rwf171789448553.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.JEWELLERY-1200_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方經調查分析及翻查大量閉路電視片段，同日晚上8時左右，在青衣一間酒店拘捕一名外籍疑犯，正扣留調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-15T05:20:22.140264+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}